Found a wand of polymorph this morning, and was bored watching my two
kittens wander aimlessly through the maze, so i waited till they were in
line with each other and zapped em both. got a pet hezrou, and a pet
gremlin named norman. i left the room and in the next room three g's
came wandering in behind me. i stepped up and prepared to smack one of
them, but it said "you stop to avoid hitting your pet gremlin" 'weird'
thinks i, 'he lost his name.' so i try to hit the next gremlin and get
'you stop to avoid hitting norman.' by time i got to the end of the
level i'd started polymorphing tons of pet gremlins, ended up with a pet
straw golem, a pet centaur, a pet large kobold, and a pet black dragon,
still had the hezrou and 3 or 4 more gremlins. was wild

of course, i did something stupid and died on the next level...

